# ---- never commit binaries ----
# The APK is 214 MB and GitHub HARD-BLOCKS any file over 100 MiB in git.
# This is not a style choice: removing these lines makes `git push` fail.
# The APK ships as a GitHub *Release* asset instead - see README.
*.apk
*.idsig
*.apks
*.aab
*.dex
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.pem
*.pk8

# ---- signing material: NEVER commit ----
*.x509.pem
testkey.p12
testkey.pk8
debug.keystore
local.properties

# ---- build output ----
build/
dist/
out/
*.log

# ---- OS / editor ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp